                <mxCell id="idgF_Fbc9nhU_HcW70fU-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Add dynamic projects feature&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;: this feature allows admin from adding projects in projects display in Mafazaa main website. Each project will have title, description, image, website URL, and can be activated or featured or not from admin dashboard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
